      "key": "K0074",
      "place": null,
      "source": "self",
      "text": "On Day 14: from about 21:00 to 00:15 I was at the Crooked Pike; from about 00:15 to 08:15 I was at home, asleep for most of it; around 08:09 I passed through Mill Road; around 08:15 I passed through the square; from about 08:15 to 09:15 I was at the grocery; around 09:10 I passed through the square; around 09:12 I passed through Mill Road; from about 09:15 to 11:15 I was at home; around 11:09 I passed through Mill Road; around 11:15 I passed through the square; from about 11:15 to 11:45 I was at the Crooked Pike.",
      "time": 19979,
      "topics": [
       "whereabouts"
      ]
     },
